Article IX — Prohibition of Insulting Islam

Any member who insults, curses, or deliberately disrespects Islam, Allah, or the Prophet Muhammad (peace be upon him) within the GC server shall be subject to disciplinary action.
The penalty for violating this Article shall be a 48-hour ban from the server.
This Article applies to all members without exception.
The rule concerns deliberate insults and does not prohibit respectful religious discussion, genuine questions, or good-faith disagreement.

Article X — Penalty for Threatening the Victim

If the offender threatens the victim in connection with an incident or dispute within GC, an additional 2-hour ban shall be imposed for the threat itself.
This penalty shall be applied in addition to any other penalty imposed for the original offense.
The threat must be supported by available evidence before the penalty is imposed.
This Article applies to all members without exception.
